#: frontend/templates/passwords.html:5
msgid "How to Set a Strong Password – HSBC HK"
msgstr "如何設定高強度密碼？ - 香港滙豐"

#: frontend/templates/android-malware-safety-measures.html:13
msgid "Cyber security and fraud hub"
msgstr "網路安全及防詐騙資訊中心"
#: frontend/templates/passwords.html:11
msgid "How to Set a Strong Password"
msgstr "如何設定高強度密碼？"

#: frontend/templates/passwords.html:12
msgid ""
"You probably have dozens of user names and passwords, for everything from"
" checking your water bill to connecting to your home Wi-Fi. Of all of "
"them, the passwords you choose for online banking are possibly the most "
"important."
msgstr "您可能有數十組用戶名稱和密碼，例如檢查水費單、連接家居Wi-Fi等 。在所有這些密碼中，您為網上理財服務選擇的密碼或許最為重要。"

#: frontend/templates/passwords.html:19
msgid ""
"Hackers are constantly upping their game with ever more sophisticated "
"ways of getting your information. But choosing a strong password – and "
"updating it regularly – will go a long way toward protecting your "
"information, which in turn will protect your finances."
msgstr "黑客不斷改良方法，以日益精密的技巧奪取個人資料，選用高強度的密碼並定期更改，將可發揮巨大的資料保護作用，從而有利於保障個人財產。"

#: frontend/templates/passwords.html:22
msgid "Tips to strengthen your password"
msgstr "強化密碼有辦法"

#: frontend/templates/passwords.html:23
msgid ""
"The strongest password you can choose won’t be a normal word or phrase. "
"It will be a (seemingly) random combination of letters (both upper and "
"lower case), numbers and symbols. It will look like gibberish, but it can"
" still have a special meaning for you so you can easily remember it."
msgstr "您能夠選用的最強密碼，絕對不會是日常所用的字詞或短語，而是由字母（大、小寫兼用）、數字及符號組成的（看似）隨意組合。此密碼令人摸不着頭腦，但對您來說可能別具意義，因此能輕易牢記。"

#: frontend/templates/passwords.html:24
msgid ""
"Choose something you love, but don’t make it obvious. If you choose a "
"password like “Friends” because that’s your favourite TV show, hackers "
"might be able guess it by looking at your social media feeds. But you "
"could use “6fadc@CP” because it will be easy for you to remember that the"
" “six friends always drink coffee at Central Perk”."
msgstr ""
"可選擇喜愛的事物，但切勿「無遮無掩」。如您因為鍾情電視劇《Friends》而以此為密碼，黑客在查看您的社交媒體反饋便有機會猜中。相反，您大可將密碼設定為「6fadc@CP」，隱含着「six"
" friends always drink coffee at Central Perk（六個朋友總愛在Central "
"Perk喝咖啡）」的意思，讓您易於記住。"

#: frontend/templates/passwords.html:25
msgid ""
"Same thing if you love classic rock: “RollingStones” would be a weak "
"password. But “Icgns!65” would be good one because you’ll remember that "
"the song (I Can’t Get No) Satisfaction came out in 1965."
msgstr ""
"若您喜愛的是經典搖滾樂亦大同小異：「RollingStones」會是低強度的密碼；相反，「Icgns!65」是不錯之選，因為您不會忘記《 (I "
"Can’t Get No) Satisfaction》一曲是在1965年推出。"

#: frontend/templates/passwords.html:27
msgid ""
"Choose a unique password for online banking and don’t use it for anything"
" else"
msgstr "為網上理財服務設定單獨的密碼，而不兼用於其他服務／戶口"

#: frontend/templates/passwords.html:28
msgid "Choose a new password once a month"
msgstr "每月設定新密碼一次"

#: frontend/templates/passwords.html:29
msgid "Log out of websites and devices when you are finished using them"
msgstr "在使用完畢時，登出網站及裝置"

#: frontend/templates/passwords.html:30
msgid "Use a combination of letters (upper & lower case), numbers and symbols"
msgstr "採用由字母（大、小寫兼用）、數字及符號組成的密碼。"

#: frontend/templates/passwords.html:32
msgid "Don't"
msgstr "謹記不要："

#: frontend/templates/passwords.html:34
msgid ""
"Use anything that would be easy to work out with a little background "
"knowledge: your username, actual name, name of family members, pets, "
"favourite football teams, birthday etc."
msgstr "選用一個單憑對您的簡單認識已能破解的密碼，如用戶名稱、真實名字、家人名字、寵物、最喜愛的足球隊伍、生日等"

#: frontend/templates/passwords.html:35
msgid ""
"Use the word ‘password’, numerical sequences (for example 12345), easily "
"recognised keypad patterns (“14780”, “qwerty”, etc) or a single "
"commonplace dictionary word that could be cracked by common hacking "
"programs"
msgstr "使用可由一般黑客程式拆解的密碼，如「password」一字、數字序列（如12345）、易於識辨的鍵次組合（如「14780」、「qwerty」）或常見單字"

#: frontend/templates/passwords.html:36
msgid "Write your passwords down or share them with anyone"
msgstr "寫下或與他人分享密碼"

#: frontend/templates/passwords.html:37
msgid ""
"Use the same user ID and password of your internet banking for other "
"online services"
msgstr "將網上理財服務的用戶名稱和密碼同樣用於其他網上服務"

#: frontend/templates/passwords.html:39
msgid ""
"Remember: no HSBC employee will ever ask you for your password or OTP "
"(One-Time-Password). If you receive a call or email from someone claiming"
" to be an HSBC employee, government official or even a member of law "
"enforcement and they ask you for your password, ignore the call and "
"contact us immediately."
msgstr "請謹記：滙豐僱員絕對不會索取您的密碼或一次性密碼(OTP)。如您收到自稱是滙豐僱員、政府官員甚或執法機關人員的來電或電郵，而他們向您索取密碼，請務必不予理會並立即向我們舉報。"

